SUMMARY:Dueling Pianos: VOTA Speakeasy
DESCRIPTION:BVEF’s Valley of the Arts (VOTA) speakeasy + auction is BVEF’s biggest fundraiser of the year. All proceeds from this adults-only evening benefit our district-wide art\, music and dance programs students receive during the regular school day. \nDueling Pianos live entertainment by the Kelly Twins from Sacramento \nRoaming food stations with food from some of your neighborhood favorites \nLocal wine\, beer\, cocktails and mocktails \nLive auction \nRaffles and fun games \nBUY YOUR TICKETS EARLY AND SAVE!\nEarly price until March 13: $85 (save $45)\nRegular price March 14-April 10: $110 (save $25)\, enter code FOOLS for one more day for a $20 discount.\nLast minute price April 11 – April 17: $130 \n(All tickets include entrance\, food\, and 2 drinks tickets) \nWHAT ARE DUELING PIANOS?\nIt’s a high energy\, interactive\, playful competition between performers that turn the whole room into part of the show. Dueling pianos are a rare treat in Sonoma County\, so you won’t want to miss The Kelly Twins! Check out one of their recent performances to see the vibe. \nSTRESSED ABOUT WHAT TO WEAR?\nDon’t be! It’s Speakeasy theme so you can dress in 20s attire or just wear wine country business casual.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/dueling-pianos-vota-speakeasy/
LOCATION:Friedman Event Center\, 4676 Mayette Ave.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/VOTA-s.jpg
GEO:38.4438;-122.666
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Friedman Event Center 4676 Mayette Ave. Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=4676 Mayette Ave.:geo:-122.666,38.4438
END:VEVENT
