SUMMARY:Jeremy Gorman Project at The Block
DESCRIPTION:With a deep knowledge of music theory\, along with a vast range of musical tastes\, Jeremy creates story-driven songs that capture ideas of hope and gratitude and of his own personal life’s journey. \nIt is quite difficult to place Jeremy Gorman’s music in a specific genre-box\, as he draws from the likes of Jazz\, Blues\, Rock\, classical and other styles\, and yet\, he manages to bring them all together into one cohesive sound.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/jeremy-gorman-project-at-the-block/
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma\, 20 Grey Street\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
