SUMMARY:Poyntlyss Sistars at the Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:The Poyntlyss Sistars Rockin’ Show Band is a popular dance band that enjoys a broad fan base throughout the SF Bay Area. Our show features familiar dance hits from the 50’s to now\, with costume changes between sets. We are a fully choreographed\, visually and technically dynamic show band\, and we bring lots of glitz and glitter to the stage. We play to delighted audiences of all ages\, and always leave them wanting more! \n  \nJAM Productions\, working exclusively with PSB\, offers quality sound and lighting for all indoor and outdoor venues\, as needed. Our fees are competitive and we endeavor to work within budget constraints for both private and public events. With sufficient lead time\, we are able to work up theme-related material or honor requests for special songs or instrumentals. \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/poyntlyss-sistars-at-the-penngrove-pub/
LOCATION:Penngrove Pub\, 10005 Main Street\, Penngrove\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
