DESCRIPTION:**SANTA ROSA\, CA – April 16\, 2026** Bedroom pop artist Vista Francisco will be releasing a 5-song EP\, *Few Years\, Few More* in collaboration with Santa Rosa Junior College’s student record label Don’t Flunk Me Records. Their release party will be Friday April 17th at the Arlene Francis Center\, 99 6th Street\, Santa Rosa\, and will include performances by Vista Francisco\, Lean-To\, and Strawberry Farm.
