SUMMARY:"April in Paris"  Flower Show and Plant Sale (April 17-18)
DESCRIPTION:This world “in transition” can be horrifying and at best intense\, so this spring 2026 the Graton Community Club has chosen to look back to another time and place: “April in Paris”. We all need a little respite.\nThe Club will be offering not only our signature theme-focused flower arrangements and affordable spring garden plants and veggie starts\, but an outing at “Café de Graton” in the dining room with a French-themed luncheon\, beverages and homemade desserts\, all for $15. \nThis 2-day event is FREE and all are welcome! In addition to the plants\, flowers show\, tasty lunch and desserts – there will be hand-made crafts\, quilts\, novelties… something for everyone! Bring your family\, friends and neighbors. \nTake a welcome break from the intensity and join us on Friday-Saturday\, April 17 -18 (9am-4pm both days) in downtown Graton. Bathe in live local music and community connections. Then\, take that LOVE back out into the world—we all need it. \nProceeds for this fundraiser event go towards scholarship support for West County local students\, and helping to maintain the historic Graton Community Club building.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/april-in-paris-flower-show-and-plant-sale-april-17-18/2026-04-18/
LOCATION:Graton Community Club\, 8996 Graton Road\, Graton\, CA
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Music,Other
GEO:38.436462827348116;-122.86834550828678
