SUMMARY:Earth Day at Safari West
DESCRIPTION:Party for the Planet: Safari West Edition! Dress as Your Favorite Animal!\nJoin us as we come together to celebrate Earth Day at Safari West. As valued guests of Safari West\, you’re essential partners in our mission to protect and preserve our planet’s precious ecosystems. Immerse yourself in an Earth Day adventure at Safari West before or after your safari as you see our glorious animals! This Earth Day\, we’re hosting a special event for our guests\, featuring over 40 conservation groups dedicated to safeguarding species worldwide. Explore inspiring organizations committed to conservation and join us in making a difference! \nGuests are encouraged to dress as their favorite animal and\, enjoy a safari adventure all your own. \nBook your safari today and come party for the planet with Safari West and Friends on Saturday\, April 18\, 2026!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/earth-day-at-safari-west/
LOCATION:Safari West\, 3115 Porter Creek Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Holiday,Kids and Family
