SUMMARY:Sacred 3: Homage to Mother Earth | Artist Talk
DESCRIPTION:Artist Mary Vaughan hosts 12 Artists to celebrate Earth Day Month by showing 3 pieces each from their body of work and leading an Artist Talk on Saturday\, April 18 at 11am. Each Artist will give a 3 min talk on their 3 chosen pieces in homage to the Earth. Consider eating before or after this Talk at one of the cozy cafes on the South A Arts Block known as SOFA. Cafe Frida is open 7am to 7pm and Red Bird Bakery is open 8am to 2pm on Saturdays.
