SUMMARY:Spring Celebration at Charlie's Acres
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Charlie’s Acres on Saturday\, April 18 for our Spring Celebration: a fun-filled\, family-friendly event to welcome the season with rescued animals! This is a great opportunity to have a heartwarming outing and learn something new\, all while benefitting the animals at our sanctuary! \nHere’s what you can look forward to:\n-Sanctuary Tour & Animal Meet-and-Greets – Walk around our sanctuary loop to treat our friendly residents to snacks and gentle affection\, all while learning their rescue stories and fun details about their unique personalities.\n-Delicious Eats – Indulge in festive food available for purchase from the Vegan Circus Carnival Food Truck.\n-Scavenger Hunt – A fun adventure for the kiddos as they explore and learn about the animals.\n-Game Time – Indoor and outdoor games for all ages.\n-Prizes – Play fun games for a chance to take home exciting prizes! \nWe’ll be hosting this event rain or shine! Proceeds from this event benefit the lifelong care of our 150 rescued animal residents and our free humane education programs for schools. \nEntry times at 11:00\, 11:15\, 11:30\, 11:45 AM\, and 12:00 PM. Don’t miss out on this uplifting celebration! Tickets are limited; get yours today: https://www.charliesacres.org/visit/
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spring-celebration-at-charlies-acres/
LOCATION:Charlie’s Acres Farm Animal Sanctuary\, 3201 Napa Rd\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Kids and Family,Other,Recreation
GEO:38.26340;-122.41003
